00,1020000,1380000,180000],"nar":[{"lap":0,"text":"The Grand Prix and the Coupe de l'Auto voiturettes run together over two days, ten laps each day; 47 cars start at 30-second intervals.","q":false},{"lap":0,"text":"At 5:30 in the morning, the first car, the green Sunbeam of Rigal chased away and in gaps of 30 seconds followed the remaining 46 cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":1,"text":"Shortly after 6 a.m. appeared the first car, H\u00e9mery (Lorraine-Di\u00e9trich), followed by Rigal (Sunbeam), Goux (Peugeot), then the FIAT of Wagner ahead of Bruce-Brown.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":46},{"lap":1,"text":"On time Bruce-Brown leads by 82 seconds from Boillot, with H\u00e9mery, Goux and Heim next; Rigal heads the 3-litre cars.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":2,"text":"Bruce-Brown leads Boillot by only 13 seconds; H\u00e9mery, Heim, Guyot and Gabriel are out.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":3,"text":"A handbrake cable breaks on Boillot's Peugeot; he stops for some minutes at Criel to have it reconnected and falls almost three minutes behind.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"Goux (Peugeot) lost third place when a large stone holed his fuel tank which he sealed from the inside with a plug. For that he had to drain all remaining fuel and was forced to take on fuel away from the pits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":25},{"lap":3,"text":"Collinet's Gr\u00e9goire runs into the ditch and overturns at Lehamel; his mechanic Bassagnana is killed.","q":false,"c":41},{"lap":4,"text":"Bruce-Brown stops for tyres and Wagner changes a wheel and refuels; both Boillot's rear tyres blow as he leaves the Fourche, costing him more than nine minutes.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"Bruce-Brown (Fiat) was still in the lead, Boillot (Peugeot) had climbed up to second place, 6m30s behind the leader, while Wagner (FIAT) fell to 3rd place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"Hancock (Vauxhall) rose from sixth to fourth spot and now led the Coupe de L'Auto with Resta following four minutes behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":20},{"lap":6,"text":"Wagner moves back to second, six minutes behind Bruce-Brown; Boillot is third.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":7,"text":"DePalma drops to ninth after a pit stop.","q":false,"c":26},{"lap":8,"text":"Boillot is back in second as Wagner stops for a tyre; Resta sets a Coupe de l'Auto lap record and climbs to fourth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Six cars retire, among them Zuccarelli's Peugeot and Bablot's Lorraine-Di\u00e9trich.","q":false,"c":30},{"lap":9,"text":"Bruce-Brown's lead over Boillot is under four minutes.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":10,"text":"End of the first day: Bruce-Brown leads Boillot by just over two minutes, Wagner third; 27 cars have completed the ten laps.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":10,"text":"Second day: rain at the 6 a.m. restart. Goux and DePalma are disqualified for refuelling away from the pits; the Gr\u00e9goires of Renaux and Romano are withdrawn.","q":false},{"lap":10,"text":"Eventually, 22 cars were ready to start in the order in which they had finished on the previous day.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":11,"text":"In the rain Bruce-Brown extends his lead over Boillot to more than six minutes.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":12,"text":"Bruce-Brown (Fiat) was now leading by just 1m25s ahead of Boillot (Peugeot) who was making up time","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":13,"text":"Bruce-Brown (Fiat) still held the lead, but by only nine seconds ahead of Boillot (Peugeot) who had been turning laps below 40 minutes.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":13,"text":"Medinger's fuel tank was damaged by a flying stone causing a leak. He now stopped each lap to refill and was able to continue.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":14,"text":"Boillot takes the lead: Bruce-Brown runs out of fuel before Eu with a broken fuel line and refuels on the course after a repair.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Wagner passes Bruce-Brown, who is disqualified for refuelling on the course and no longer counts in the classification.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":16,"text":"Boillot leads Wagner by 31 minutes; Hancock's Vauxhall retires with a broken piston.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":17,"text":"Garcet (Calthorpe) withdrew with a broken connecting rod while Page disappeared after he overturned his Alcyon at Ancourt \"S\" bend without anybody being injured.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":18,"text":"Boillot has to stop with the gearbox shift broken; after the repair he has only second and fourth gears, and his lead is down to just over six minutes.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":19,"text":"Boillot (Peugeot) had only two speeds left in his gearbox, but he still drove so fast, 37m34s, that nobody could catch him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"At the beginning of this lap Wagner decided to change one wheel and by doing so lost once more several minutes to Boillot.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":20,"text":"Boillot wins, 13 minutes ahead of Wagner; Rigal beats Resta by over a minute for third, Medinger fifth: Sunbeam take the first three places in the Coupe de l'Auto.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"Reid is flagged off and does not classify.","q":false,"c":14}]}